WEBVTT

01:29.450 --> 01:33.030
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.640 --> 01:36.229
[Episode 6]

01:40.680 --> 01:42.240
You've really screwed me over.

01:42.240 --> 01:43.620
This time, I took it upon myself

01:43.620 --> 01:44.720
and put you two in danger.

01:44.720 --> 01:45.520
I'm sorry.

01:45.720 --> 01:47.250
You must be out of your mind.

01:54.240 --> 01:55.320
What are you doing?

01:55.620 --> 01:56.900
What are you up to now?

01:58.690 --> 01:59.420
Who's there?

02:02.060 --> 02:03.160
What are you doing?

02:08.669 --> 02:09.470
Come on.

02:09.680 --> 02:11.300
No, go away.

02:12.870 --> 02:14.030
Don't touch me!

02:19.720 --> 02:21.050
What's the point of untying us now?

02:21.050 --> 02:22.579
I shouldn't have trusted you.

02:22.579 --> 02:24.329
Now, my life is threatened because of you.

02:24.329 --> 02:25.250
Dao,

02:25.280 --> 02:26.700
please don't be mad.

02:26.730 --> 02:28.980
Yanzhi must have her own reason
for doing so.

02:28.980 --> 02:30.040
Let me do it myself.

02:32.320 --> 02:33.079
Seriously,

02:33.079 --> 02:34.720
Nan Yanzhi, what exactly is your plan?

02:34.720 --> 02:36.120
Right, Yanzhi.

02:36.140 --> 02:37.280
I don't get it either.

02:37.280 --> 02:39.500
Why did you reject
the position of champion?

02:39.500 --> 02:40.700
Taking that position

02:40.760 --> 02:42.310
won't bring us to the third floor.

02:42.310 --> 02:45.850
Didn't they say the champion would receive
a grand reward?

02:46.590 --> 02:48.390
That's indeed what Ms. Qin said.

02:58.920 --> 03:00.400
This is the grand reward for the champion.

03:00.400 --> 03:01.360
See for yourselves.

03:01.110 --> 03:02.790
[For the champion]

03:09.980 --> 03:10.900
This is...

03:11.080 --> 03:12.440
This is poppy.

03:12.750 --> 03:14.590
It's mixed with various mushroom powders.

03:14.590 --> 03:15.790
You know about herbs?

03:16.350 --> 03:16.950
Yes.

03:16.980 --> 03:19.150
I used to collect herbs in mountains
with my grandfather.

03:19.150 --> 03:21.880
So I was exposed to
many types of medicinal herbs.

03:21.920 --> 03:23.040
Then what on earth

03:23.880 --> 03:25.040
is this thing?

03:25.060 --> 03:26.320
He who takes in too much of this

03:26.320 --> 03:28.400
will end up being a walking corpse

03:28.420 --> 03:29.720
like these students.

03:29.850 --> 03:30.770
If that's true,

03:30.790 --> 03:33.430
isn't everyone in the academy
a puppet of Ms. Qin's?

03:33.430 --> 03:34.360
That's right.

03:34.890 --> 03:37.340
Good thing we didn't team up
with those two girls.

03:37.340 --> 03:39.420
Or we would be trapped here forever.

03:39.480 --> 03:42.630
Ms. Qin spends every day
with these puppets.

03:42.760 --> 03:44.240
Doesn't she find it creepy?

03:44.240 --> 03:45.440
Perhaps some people are just

03:45.440 --> 03:47.480
glad to indulge themselves in illusions

03:47.480 --> 03:50.140
and to enjoy such kind
of delusional happiness.

03:51.270 --> 03:53.240
Then those people are hopelessly stupid.

03:53.240 --> 03:54.940
The more joyful they are in the dreams,

03:54.940 --> 03:56.700
the more miserable they feel
as they wake up.

03:56.700 --> 03:57.680
If it were me,

03:57.920 --> 03:59.710
even under severe torture, I'd still

03:59.710 --> 04:00.900
stand on my feet with a clear head.

04:00.900 --> 04:02.780
Trying to make me eat this kind of stuff?

04:02.780 --> 04:03.620
No way!

04:03.830 --> 04:04.830
How dare you!

04:08.240 --> 04:09.430
Who let you in?

04:09.450 --> 04:10.890
Some people talk about

04:11.170 --> 04:12.710
morals and righteousness all the time.

04:12.710 --> 04:14.710
However, look at what they've done.

04:15.160 --> 04:16.490
They shouldn't be teachers at all.

04:16.490 --> 04:18.510
Since I took charge of the academy,

04:18.640 --> 04:19.860
I've never met

04:19.890 --> 04:21.899
students as unruly as you lot.

04:22.040 --> 04:24.400
It seems like someone's asking
to learn her lesson

04:24.400 --> 04:25.620
the hard way.

04:31.710 --> 04:32.740
Officer Qin!

04:34.159 --> 04:35.180
What did you call me?

04:35.180 --> 04:36.220
"Officer Qin."

04:44.730 --> 04:45.930
After so many years,

04:46.040 --> 04:48.020
I can't believe
someone's calling me that again.

04:48.020 --> 04:48.800
Officer Qin,

04:48.800 --> 04:51.360
you were once the most reputed
lady of talent in the dynasty.

04:51.360 --> 04:54.120
You once managed imperial decrees
for the Empress Dowager

04:54.120 --> 04:56.480
with the power to draft edicts
and command all officials.

04:56.480 --> 04:58.080
Am I wrong for addressing you

04:58.330 --> 04:59.330
as "Officer Qin"?

05:01.430 --> 05:03.300
You revealed my true identity.

05:03.330 --> 05:05.440
Aren't you afraid that I might kill you?

05:05.440 --> 05:07.700
Of course you could kill me, Officer Qin.

05:08.120 --> 05:09.080
But before my life ends,

05:09.080 --> 05:10.040
I have a question

05:10.600 --> 05:12.840
for the once most talented lady,
who, in everyone's eyes,

05:12.840 --> 05:14.960
was kind and fully committed
to the people.

05:14.960 --> 05:15.840
Does she...

05:16.470 --> 05:17.640
still exist?

05:25.600 --> 05:26.880
She already died.

05:28.860 --> 05:31.590
I'd rather grow old clinging
to a fragrant branch

05:31.600 --> 05:33.940
than dance with yellow leaves
in the autumn wind.

05:33.940 --> 05:35.520
This famous quote was written

05:35.520 --> 05:37.480
by Officer Qin at her rite of passage.

05:37.480 --> 05:39.120
If the old her were dead,

05:39.140 --> 05:41.800
how could I have won
the championship this time?

05:43.030 --> 05:44.500
What else do you know?

05:44.640 --> 05:45.920
It's said that she was gifted
to the Crown Prince

05:45.920 --> 05:47.620
since the Empress Dowager fell from grace.

05:47.620 --> 05:49.620
Nobody has heard from her thereafter.

05:49.620 --> 05:51.440
That said, exactly

05:51.440 --> 05:52.960
because of Officer Qin, many women

05:52.960 --> 05:54.080
were admitted to academies.

05:54.080 --> 05:55.040
They got to learn,

05:55.040 --> 05:56.159
to break free from traditional dogmas,

05:56.159 --> 05:57.260
and to make a living for themselves.

05:57.260 --> 05:58.380
Up to this day,

05:58.409 --> 05:59.340
in their hearts,

05:59.610 --> 06:02.070
Officer Qin is still
the most talented woman

06:02.160 --> 06:04.220
and an excellent female chancellor.

06:06.840 --> 06:09.520
I hate for my talent in poetry
to be concealed by pretty gowns.

06:09.520 --> 06:12.360
Looking up, I can only admire
the chosen scholars on the list.

06:12.360 --> 06:14.820
So what if I used to be
the most talented lady?

06:14.930 --> 06:17.390
Without the Empress Dowager's protection,

06:17.480 --> 06:20.480
I was simply a plaything
decorated with gold and jade.

06:21.200 --> 06:23.660
Once such a woman
falls into the hands of men,

06:24.060 --> 06:26.300
all her talent becomes useless.

06:26.410 --> 06:28.670
They don't care about her gift in poetry.

06:29.080 --> 06:30.600
All they care about

06:31.400 --> 06:32.800
is the body hidden

06:32.800 --> 06:34.960
beneath her thin clothes.

06:36.200 --> 06:37.400
What a shame.

06:38.000 --> 06:40.400
I blame my young self
for being too arrogant

06:40.600 --> 06:42.860
and conceited due to my talent back then.

06:43.950 --> 06:45.070
Stay away from me!

06:45.480 --> 06:48.720
I will never sleep
with a good-for-nothing like you!

06:49.270 --> 06:51.070
I demand to see the Crown Prince!

06:53.120 --> 06:54.920
I demand to see the Crown Prince!

07:23.680 --> 07:25.810
I considered myself noble and refused

07:26.800 --> 07:28.400
to please men with my beauty.

07:30.240 --> 07:32.440
I even drew a cut across that man's neck.

07:34.350 --> 07:36.010
However, the Crown Prince...

07:37.010 --> 07:38.780
He determined that I was guilty

07:39.490 --> 07:41.150
and threw me into prison.

07:41.440 --> 07:42.830
Only then did I realize

07:43.200 --> 07:45.520
that he wasn't interested in me at all.

07:46.120 --> 07:48.440
He only meant to eliminate
an important aide
to the Empress Dowager.

07:48.440 --> 07:50.380
Without the latter's protection,

07:50.560 --> 07:52.260
I was reduced to a prisoner

07:52.280 --> 07:54.080
trampled upon by anyone at will.

07:54.600 --> 07:57.240
Even the lowest of the low could abuse me.

08:05.710 --> 08:06.710
At that moment,

08:07.440 --> 08:09.200
all my talent,

08:09.300 --> 08:10.890
all my learning,

08:11.400 --> 08:13.040
and all my loyalty,

08:13.660 --> 08:15.260
became a joke.

08:22.240 --> 08:23.520
Then, Officer Qin,

08:24.320 --> 08:25.910
how did you end up here?

08:26.000 --> 08:28.200
I thought I would be tortured to death

08:28.800 --> 08:30.530
and thrown into the mass grave.

08:30.640 --> 08:32.240
But noticing my proficiency in medicine,

08:32.240 --> 08:34.039
the master of Lingya Tower bought me,

08:34.039 --> 08:35.700
so I could help him test drugs.

08:37.059 --> 08:38.200
Do you know

08:38.820 --> 08:40.220
you're aiding the evil?

08:42.280 --> 08:43.640
This tower is filled with sins.

08:43.640 --> 08:44.800
So what?

08:45.040 --> 08:47.700
I stopped caring about morality
a long time ago.

08:48.280 --> 08:50.320
At least, here, I have my academy

08:52.080 --> 08:53.690
and my students.

08:54.600 --> 08:56.730
I can be a teacher and impart knowledge

08:57.000 --> 08:58.120
at this place.

08:58.120 --> 08:59.760
This is not an academy at all.

08:59.780 --> 09:01.550
And those are not your students.

09:01.550 --> 09:03.760
They're all manipulated
by that bell of yours!

09:03.760 --> 09:05.790
You're drowned in your own illusion.

09:05.790 --> 09:08.790
How are you any different
from those walking corpses?

09:10.200 --> 09:12.130
So what if this is just an illusion?

09:13.520 --> 09:16.080
My life is already shattered and ruined.

09:16.320 --> 09:18.320
All I want to do is stay in my own dream

09:19.240 --> 09:21.160
that transcends the mundane.

09:22.300 --> 09:24.260
What's wrong with idling the rest

09:24.690 --> 09:26.490
of my life away in a lovely dream?

09:29.790 --> 09:31.560
That slap was to wake you up,

09:31.560 --> 09:32.440
Officer Qin.

09:33.280 --> 09:34.700
A woman though you are,

09:34.720 --> 09:35.800
you unconventionally and bravely

09:35.800 --> 09:37.750
broke the chains of traditional doctrines.

09:37.750 --> 09:39.560
You have what it takes
to govern the country

09:39.560 --> 09:41.290
and the ability to strategize.

09:41.470 --> 09:43.800
Yet now you've willingly degraded yourself

09:43.800 --> 09:46.160
into a lackey
for the exploitative privileged!

09:46.160 --> 09:47.840
Easy for you to say that.

09:49.110 --> 09:50.350
I'm in a living hell

09:50.380 --> 09:51.690
with no strength to climb up.

09:51.690 --> 09:53.040
Even if I hate all of this,

09:53.040 --> 09:54.280
what can I do?

09:55.690 --> 09:56.880
My life is worthless.

09:56.880 --> 09:58.150
What can I do?

09:59.140 --> 10:00.590
If you do hate all of this,

10:01.050 --> 10:02.910
then fight till your last breath,

10:03.000 --> 10:04.160
kill those vile people,

10:04.160 --> 10:05.200
leave this living hell,

10:05.200 --> 10:06.800
and lead a decent life again!

10:21.680 --> 10:23.280
You really are interesting.

10:24.240 --> 10:24.880
Tell me.

10:25.370 --> 10:26.670
After all this hustle,

10:27.320 --> 10:28.720
what exactly do you want?

10:32.400 --> 10:33.530
I want the antidote.

10:47.320 --> 10:48.080
Ms. Qin,

10:48.680 --> 10:50.480
I've always been curious about one thing.

10:50.480 --> 10:51.780
How did the previous captives

10:51.780 --> 10:53.540
make it past the second floor?

10:53.640 --> 10:55.240
It's actually quite simple.

10:56.040 --> 10:59.200
As long as you manage to come here
at midnight,

10:59.740 --> 11:01.890
a mute servant will take you
to the third floor.

11:01.890 --> 11:02.960
It's that simple?

11:04.120 --> 11:06.400
I've imposed a strict curfew in here.

11:06.600 --> 11:08.260
Do you think everyone else is like you?

11:08.260 --> 11:09.330
I see.

11:16.850 --> 11:19.660
If you find it impossible to stay
on the third floor anymore,

11:19.660 --> 11:21.520
you are always welcome back here.

11:30.520 --> 11:33.050
I'm not sure if it's right
to bring you with me.

11:50.000 --> 11:51.360
You put on quite an act.

11:53.340 --> 11:54.480
You told her my true identity,

11:54.480 --> 11:55.400
didn't you?

11:56.870 --> 11:58.000
I don't understand.

11:58.780 --> 12:00.600
I invited you time and again before,

12:00.600 --> 12:02.040
yet you never responded.

12:03.280 --> 12:04.840
Why did you open your heart

12:05.360 --> 12:07.270
to her this time?

12:07.400 --> 12:08.360
I bet you're not

12:08.730 --> 12:10.930
making this visit for the Tower Master,

12:11.060 --> 12:12.260
but for her, right?

12:16.370 --> 12:18.000
I will report to the Tower Master

12:18.000 --> 12:19.530
that there is nothing wrong

12:20.890 --> 12:22.220
with the Elite Academy.

12:23.130 --> 12:24.210
Wait a moment!

12:26.620 --> 12:28.800
You said you would help me kill

12:28.820 --> 12:30.440
the person who put me in prison.

12:30.440 --> 12:31.440
Do you mean it?

12:34.160 --> 12:34.960
We both know

12:34.960 --> 12:36.340
that person holds immense power.

12:36.340 --> 12:37.470
If you want revenge,

12:38.200 --> 12:40.360
we must work together.

12:40.840 --> 12:41.640
Fine.

12:42.240 --> 12:43.320
If you help me,

12:43.840 --> 12:44.910
I will help her.

13:07.260 --> 13:11.850
[The Third Floor of Lingya Tower]

13:09.500 --> 13:11.060
What crummy place is this?

13:11.710 --> 13:14.560
Isn't each floor supposed to be better
than the last?

13:14.560 --> 13:16.960
This looks even worse
than the first floor.

13:17.140 --> 13:19.470
What kind of match awaits us
on this floor?

13:19.570 --> 13:22.170
Are the three of us
the only participants here?

13:40.720 --> 13:42.420
Have you heard...

13:47.460 --> 13:48.860
any unusual sounds?

13:48.920 --> 13:49.640
Yes.

13:52.670 --> 13:55.630
Sounds like a blacksmith shop.

13:56.460 --> 13:58.460
What exactly is this match about?

14:00.720 --> 14:02.320
What is this match about?

14:02.400 --> 14:04.610
Is it really just among the three of us?

14:05.040 --> 14:07.240
Why bother talking to the mute servant?

14:07.480 --> 14:09.880
Filling our stomaches
is the priority now.

14:10.000 --> 14:12.130
The food is indeed better than before.

14:13.530 --> 14:14.330
Hold on.

14:30.390 --> 14:32.190
How dare you poison the food?

14:32.220 --> 14:33.760
What on earth are you people trying to do?

14:33.760 --> 14:34.670
Seems like

14:34.960 --> 14:38.220
we'll either be poisoned
or starved to death on this floor.

14:38.480 --> 14:40.410
No wonder there's no one else here.

14:41.010 --> 14:42.630
Take us to the voice-keeper.

14:46.130 --> 14:48.190
[First Meeting]
